block -620 420 20 0 0 0 0 700 0
> \text The spread comes from the box above: Samples(float, 40) says how the reals are laid out and how thickly, and pick() lays one down. Delete that box and the spread the app was born with takes over -- 24 of them, evenly spaced.
end
